export function withRepo(config: AppConfig, repoRoot: string, options?: { readonly dataDir?: string }): AppConfig;

Home resolution, in order: `env.SANGKAR_HOME` when set and not empty (a leading `~/` expands against `env.HOME`), else `join(env.XDG_CONFIG_HOME ?? join(env.HOME ?? homedir(), ".config"), HOME_DIR_NAME)`. `env` is `options.env ?? process.env`, as today. `withRepo` returns a new object: `repoRoot` = the argument (resolved), `dataDir` = `options.dataDir ?? join(repoRoot, DATA_DIR_NAME)`, `telemetry.dir` = `join(dataDir, "telemetry")`, and `home`, `registryPath`, `daemon`, `cursorKey`, `budgets`, `telemetry.enabled` copied untouched. This file stays the only reader of the environment: no other file may read `SANGKAR_HOME`.

